==Old Norse==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|non|gem-pro|*leuganą}}. Cognates with {{cog|ang|lēoġan}} (Modern {{cog|en|lie}}), {{cog|osx|liogan}}, {{cog|nl|liegen}}, {{cog|goh|liogan}} ({{cog|de|lügen}}), {{cog|got|𐌻𐌹𐌿𐌲𐌰𐌽}}. Ultimately from {{der|non|ine-pro|*lewgʰ-}}. Indo-European cognates include {{cog|lt|lūgoti}}.

===Verb===
{{non-verb}}

# to [[lie]], to tell [[lies]]

